{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"didAddSection"}],"modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"didAddSection","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"didAddSection","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCModelActions(py)didAddSection","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copy","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCDidAddSectionAction_Block","text":"SCDidAddSectionAction_Block","preciseIdentifier":"c:SCModelActions.h@T@SCDidAddSectionAction_Block","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"didAddSection","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This action is typically used to customize automatically generated sections (e.g.: sections generated by SCArrayOfObjectsModel).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"objective-c","code":["\/\/ Objective-C","modelActions.didAddSection = ^(SCTableViewModel *tableModel, SCTableViewSection *section, NSUInteger sectionIndex)","{","    \/\/ use custom data sorting for the first section in a Core Data SCArrayOfObjectsModel","    if(sectionIndex==0 && [section isKindOfClass:[SCArrayOfObjectsSection class]])","    {","        SCArrayOfObjectsSection *objectsSection = (SCArrayOfObjectsSection *)section;","        SCCoreDataFetchOptions *oldFetchOptions = (SCCoreDataFetchOptions *)objectsSection.dataFetchOptions;","        objectsSection.dataFetchOptions = [SCCoreDataFetchOptions optionsWithSortKey:oldFetchOptions.sortKey sortAscending:FALSE filterPredicate:oldFetchOptions.filterPredicate];","    }","};"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions\/didAddSection","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Action gets called as soon as a section has been added to the model.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scmodelactions\/didaddsection"]}],"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCModelActions/didAddSection":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Action gets called as soon as a section has been added to the model."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"didAddSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scmodelactions\/didaddsection","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"didAddSection"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCModelActions\/didAddSection","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCDidAddSectionAction_Block":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A block invoked after a section is added to a table-view model."}],"title":"SCDidAddSectionAction_Block","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scdidaddsectionaction_block","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SCDidAddSectionAction_Block"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCDidAddSectionAction_Block","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCModelActions":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identif